# Patch files are applied byte-for-byte against a freshly cloned upstream
# tree, so their line endings must never be translated. Without this,
# actions/checkout converts patches/*.patch to CRLF on the Windows runner
# while the libdatachannel clone stays LF, and every context line mismatches:
#   error: patch failed: include/rtc/rtc.h:481
#   error: include/rtc/rtc.h: patch does not apply
# (windows.yml, 2026-08-03 — the Linux and macOS runners were unaffected,
# which is exactly why it reached CI rather than a local build.)
*.patch -text
*.diff -text
